{
  id: ["maul", "hammer"],
  adj: ["tempered", "steel"],
  name: "tempered steel maul",
  short: "tempered steel maul",
  long: "A blunt block of tempered steel mounted on a long ash haft banded"
        "with iron along its upper third. There is no edge to it and no"
        "finesse in it. Swung from the shoulders it simply arrives, and"
        "armour that would turn a blade only spreads the blow a little"
        "wider before it lands. It asks for both hands and a good deal of"
        "room.",
